## CLEANING THE FULL BIN SENSORS

1. Remove and empty the bin. (See Figure 8)
<PIC:Manual32_12>
{{image description: Figure 8 showing the dust bin removed from the robot vacuum before reinsertion.}}


2. Wipe the sensors with a clean, dry cloth. (See Figure 9)
<PIC:Manual32_13>
{{image description: Figure 9 underside view of the robot vacuum with two circular inset views highlighting internal bin or sensor areas.}}




3. Wipe the inner and outer sensor ports on the bin with a clean, dry cloth. (See Figure 10)
<PIC:Manual32_14>
{{image description: Figure 10 showing the dust bin with labeled Inner Sensor Ports and Outer Sensor Ports.}}
